  "description": "For socially awkward student Cho-I Kim, the abandoned \"Second Library\" is her ultimate safe haven. But Cho-I’s peaceful isolation is shattered when Do-Jin Lee, a notorious upperclassman, crashes into her secret sanctuary and discovers her biggest secret: a desperate, unrequited crush! Instead of exposing her, Do-Jin offers a wild deal: he’ll be her wingman, but only if she agrees to a fake dating contract with him first. Caught in a chaotic love triangle, can Cho-I protect her quiet life, or will the walls of her private room finally come crashing down?\n\n(Source: WEBTOON)",
